- Rust differential `heartbeat_dto_public_accessors_match_invoked_java` passes. It confirms values/defaults/null states; Java returns identical mutable Sets from getters, while Rust owns collections and lends immutable borrows. HeartbeatData producer/consumer collections retain the existing nullable Vec representation and identity multiplicity.
